# 9. Local Model Installation

**Priority: REQUIRED**

PyFlare should not force every user to install the same model.

During installation or first boot, the user should be presented with hardware-aware choices.

Example:

```text
PYFLARE INITIAL SETUP

Hardware detected:
CPU: Intel Core i5
RAM: 16 GB
GPU: Integrated Graphics
Storage: 512 GB

RECOMMENDED LOCAL AI

[ ] Small Model
    Fast / Low Memory

[ ] Medium Model
    Balanced

[ ] Large Model
    Slower / Higher Resource Usage

[ ] Do Not Install Local Model

              [ Continue ]
```

PyFlare may provide recommendations based on hardware, but the user makes the final selection.

